1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,068
Only have a minute as a parent? Here's the parents' page.

2
00:00:05,402 --> 00:00:09,242
Tap Parents at the top right and answer a quick sum to get in.

3
00:00:11,558 --> 00:00:16,904
See which characters your child recognized alone today, and which still need help.

4
00:00:16,954 --> 00:00:23,146
On the Together tab, the island suggests what to do — like telling a little story with today's word.

5
00:00:23,766 --> 00:00:29,982
If Chinese school has new words this week, enter them here and the island will teach them first for seven days.

6
00:00:30,937 --> 00:00:34,945
You can pick a daily time and add a reminder to your phone calendar.

7
00:00:35,879 --> 00:00:40,535
Print a weekly summary for the fridge so the whole family sees the progress.

8
00:00:42,209 --> 00:00:48,089
The address is on screen. How many minutes a day can you spend together? Tell me in the comments.

